{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014PruCG6WiaENykaHYCb79L","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 structfuse-context 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (11 个)\\n\\n- **gpt2_factual_recall_k3_v2**: RUNNING (negative) — \\n- **ioi_size_controlled_baseline**: PREPARING — \\n- **gpt2_factual_recall_k3**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_sva_gpt2_k3_topk**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **phase2_qwen05b_ioi_acdc_k3**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_sva_gpt2_k3**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **phase2_qwen05b_ioi_k3**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v3**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi**: DEPLOYED (killed) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-13\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| gpt2_factual_recall_k3_v2 | — | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n（无）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **gpt2_factual_recall_k3** (failed): Factual Recall (国家首都) 上 CSS=1.0 faithfulness > single-method，GPT-2 第四任务验证（D025 条件④, plan_005）\\n- **mvp_sva_gpt2_k3_topk** (negative): SVA 上 CSS=1.0 faithfulness > single-method（ACDC top-100 修正版，westd-pro6000 cuda:1）\\n  [sva_css067_fix_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/mvp_sva_gpt2_k3_topk/data/sva_css067_fix_results.txt)\\n- **phase2_qwen05b_ioi_acdc_k3** (negative): —\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 1 / 负向 5 / 失败 2 / 共 8\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-39279: 无 GPU 信息\\nwestd-pro6000: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1\\n\\n## 告警\\n- mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- gpt2_factual_recall_k3: 训练失败 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Lnv4ZGoqmppQ6fuxGfQCsS","session_id":"92ec98e3-e572-42db-9ebd-25eabdb3cb35","uuid":"7eaea1fc-84d5-4a89-838c-cd3a01539ac3","timestamp":"2026-05-13T10:14:00.810Z"}
